The image built from this directory also contains, installed at build time
and never committed: Anki's desktop package aqt (AGPL-3.0-or-later), whose
wheel holds the built graphs page this image runs, PyQt6 (GPL-3.0) and Qt 6
(LGPL-3.0/GPL), pinned in ../ankiconnect/requirements.lock. The page and its assets stay in
the image (R1960). The image is built locally and never pushed to a registry
(R1869).
